tals and phosphates from wastewater, making it valuable in environmental management and pollution control.\nL457:   * Animal Feed Supplements: Used in livestock nutrition, it helps improve the mineral balance in animal diets, promoting better growth and health.\nL458:   * Pharmaceutical Applications: This compound can be utilized in drug formulations, particularly in the development of controlled-release medications, improving therapeutic efficacy.\nL459:   * Research in Biochemistry: It is employed in various biochemical assays and studies, aiding researchers in understanding metabolic processes and nutrient interactions.\nL460: Applications\nL461: \nL462: Ammonium magnesium phosphate hexahydrate is widely utilized in research focused on:\nL463:   * Fertilizer Production: This compound serves as a slow-release fertilizer, providing essential nutrients like nitrogen and phosphorus to plants, which enhances agricultural productivity.\nL464:   * Water Treatment: It is effective in removing heavy metals and phosphates from wastewater, making it valuable in environmental management and pollution control.\nL465:   * Animal Feed Supplements: Used in livestock nutrition, it helps improve the mineral balance in animal diets, promoting better growth and health.\nL466:   * Pharmaceutical Applications: This compound can be utilized in drug formulations, particularly in the development of controlled-release medications, improving therapeutic efficacy.\nL467:   * Research in Biochemistry: It is employed in various biochemical assays and studies, aiding researchers in understanding metabolic processes and nutrient interactions.\nL468: ## Documents\nL469: \nL470: [Button: Safety Data Sheets ] [Button: Product Specification ] [Button: Certificates of Analysis ] [Button: Certificates Of Origin ]\nL471: \nL472: ###### Safety Data Sheets (SDS)\nL473: \nL474: The SDS provides comprehensive safety information on handling, storage, and disposal of the product.\nL475: \nL476: 【95†Download